.TH MARBOR\-USERS 1 "2026-08-17" "marbor dev" "Marbor Manual"
.SH NAME
marbor\-users \- manage dashboard users
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B marbor users
[action] [args] [\fIflags\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
manage dashboard users
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B list
list users
.TP
.B create
create a user (password printed once)
.RS
.TP
.B \-\-user string
username for the new user (required) (required)
.TP
.B \-\-email string
email for the new user
.TP
.B \-\-role string
role: admin or user
.RE
.TP
.B approve <id>
approve a pending user
.RS
.TP
.B \-\-api-key-name string
API key name to assign
.TP
.B \-\-create-key
create an API key for the user
.TP
.B \-\-key-rate-limit int
rate limit for the new key (per hour)
.TP
.B \-\-key-daily-limit int
daily limit for the new key
.TP
.B \-\-key-monthly-limit int
monthly limit for the new key
.TP
.B \-\-key-models string
comma\-separated allowed models for the new key
.RE
.TP
.B suspend <id>
suspend a user and revoke sessions
.RS
.TP
.B \-\-yes
confirm suspension without prompting
.RE
.TP
.B reset\-password <id>
reset a user's password (printed once)
.TP
.B patch <id>
update a user's email or role
.RS
.TP
.B \-\-email string
new email
.TP
.B \-\-role string
new role: admin or user
.RE
.TP
.B delete <id>
delete a user
.RS
.TP
.B \-\-yes
confirm deletion without prompting
.RE
.TP
.B pending\-count
show the number of users awaiting approval (P\-A2-08d)
.TP
.B change\-password
change your own password (interactive, masked prompts) (P\-A2-09d)
.TP
.B skip\-password-change
dismiss the forced\-password-change prompt for this session only (P\-A2-09d)
.SH FLAGS
.TP
.B \-\-server
Admin API base URL (default "http://localhost:8080", env MARBOR_SERVER)
.TP
.B \-\-json
output machine\-readable JSON instead of a human table
.TP
.B \-\-username
admin username, used to log in (env MARBOR_USERNAME)
.TP
.B \-\-password
admin password, used to log in (env MARBOR_PASSWORD)
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBmarbor\fR(1)
